&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is US based only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Account Executive to join as a founding member of the sales team for our new Advertising Solutions (Quests) business line. This role is perfect for someone passionate about the gaming industry and eager to help companies in this space market to their most dedicated audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global role where you will work in a dynamic, zero-to-one environment to build and grow a new, fast-expanding business line at Discord. You will harness your prior experience in advertising/media/marketing spaces and bring a combination of strategic business thinking, industry relationships, product insights, and an ability to build a significant, recurring book of business with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address clients&#39; marketing needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tailored solutions and proposals that deliver value against those needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In order to hit revenue and account goals, you will:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and source media buying opportunities with CPG, Consumer Electronics, QSR, Retail, Tech, &amp;amp; Telecommunications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deepen relationships within these industries with stakeholders &amp;amp; key decision makers at the brand direct and agency levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close deals to meet revenue and account goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients achieve business and marketing goals using Discord’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy effective and repeatable sales strategies. Apply an account planning process to prioritize accounts, grow revenue, educate clients, lead strategic client conversations, and navigate complex relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and convey compelling sales presentations and proposals utilizing internal and external data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in Discord solutions and adapt recommendations to suit varying client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with clients and contribute to marketing and media plans that enable them to reach their target audiences on Discord.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate expertise around the gaming, media, and marketing spaces to clients, within Discord, and in industry forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience as an Account Executive in direct ad sales, media buying, or digital advertising, with a focus on CPG, Consumer Electronics, QSR, Retail, Tech or Telecommunications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting or exceeding account and revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing clients throughout the funnel with a deep understanding of their challenges and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships with top marketing decision-makers and their agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data and identify insights to assess campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to proactively troubleshoot and problem-solve quickly and through the proper escalation channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketing and ad technology ecosystem including ability to collect and convey product needs as well as working cross-functionally to diagnose and solve technical problems for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in negotiating and structuring standard and non-standard ad-buying agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for regional in-person client meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $255,000 to $320,850 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is US-based only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discord is the place for all things gaming.&amp;nbsp; Discord is the place where players have their entire hangout experience with friends – from before, during, and after gaming sessions.&amp;nbsp; Discord is also the place where every major game publisher and studio maintains an official community.&amp;nbsp; And finally Discord is the place where the latest news, beta codes, and big gaming moments happen.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for Account Executives to join as founding members of the sales team for our new Quests ads business line. In this role you work on the mobile gaming business at Discord and be influential in developing our ad product offering for this segment. We are seeking an individual who is passionate about games, the game industry, and helping game companies market to the players who are most passionate about their games.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working in a zero to 1 environment to build up and grow a new, and fast-growing business line at Discord.&amp;nbsp; You will harness your prior experience in advertising/media/marketing spaces and bring a combination of strategic business thinking, industry relationships, product insights, and an ability to build a significant, recurring book of business with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate Revenue: &lt;/strong&gt;You will drive new partnerships with game publishers, studios, and their media agencies to build new and repeatable revenue streams for Discord’s emerging mobile ads business. You will prospect and source new opportunities, navigate client needs against Discord’s offerings, and negotiate and close business deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Strategic Insights: &lt;/strong&gt;You will work collaboratively and cross functionally with internal teams to bring strategic recommendations for the product road map. You will work with teammates within the sales function to build and enhance scalable processes for the growing ads business.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Client Partnerships: &lt;/strong&gt;You will work with clients to identify their marketing needs, and develop strategic proposals that deliver value against those needs. You will build and deepen longterm, strategic relationships with senior decision makers across the gaming segment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Thought Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;You will demonstrate expertise around the gaming, media, marketing, and advertising spaces to clients, within Discord, and in industry forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of direct experience in ad sales in the gaming industry, specifically in building new business from scratch with major players in the gaming sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in delivering against account and revenue goals, specifically with building new mobile business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships with top marketing decision-makers at game publishers and their agencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data and identify insights to assess campaign performance, and proactively troubleshoot and problem-solve quickly and through the proper escalation channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working internally with crossfunctional partners to influence product development and processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for regional in-person client meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The total annual target compensation range for this full-time position is $255k - $300k OTE + equity + benefits. Our compensation ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed reflect the OTE (base salary + target variable compensation) only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for leading teams responsible for the underlying building blocks of our core experience — the client itself. With a charter that spans from the tooling to the native code to the foundational React software, across all of the platforms we target, the teams here are shipping meaningful, business impacting code every day. In 2025, you will focus heavily on our mobile experience, driving top line growth and helping create international opportunities for the business in 2026 and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to our VP of Core Technology and have significant leadership and influence on the evolution of Discord&#39;s overall Engineering organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead multiple teams of highly-engaged managers and engineers by hiring, coaching, and instilling a sense of ownership and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with peers across the business to drive meaningful business impact in user engagement metrics by delivering on mobile performance and quality goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with best-in-class talent, inside and outside of Discord, to set the bar for what is possible with React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive public perception by working with teams like Marketing and Comms to talk about the work your teams are doing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage processes and use your technical expertise to continually improve the team and ensure your team achieves extraordinary results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with other Directors to continuously improve the Engineering organization and uphold our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;workplace philosophy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience as a Software Engineer and have maintained technical depth as a leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience as an Engineering Manager and successfully managed groups of 3+ Engineering Managers and 15+ Software Engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of experience managing other Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy coming up with pragmatic solutions to concrete problems using first principles thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You deeply understand mobile performance and React Native and are excited by the challenge of delivering an incredible product to 200 million users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about coaching and leading other engineers, but secretly love getting elbow deep in architecture design when the opportunities arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep up with the industry trends and identify new tools to use to solve technical problems — and are excited to push the envelope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and building new teams and departments from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background owning critical performance metrics at a company level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C++ and Native development experience, particularly on mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring for fast-growing startups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: This is not a 100% remote role. We are looking for someone to work in our San Francisco office at least 1 time per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $311,000 to $342,000 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is about giving people the power to create space to find belonging in their lives. As communities grow on our platform, we&#39;re committed to keeping our users safe by leveraging effective machine learning. We&#39;re seeking a Director of Machine Learning for Trust &amp;amp; Safety who will lead our efforts in protecting millions of users through state-of-the-art ML technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Trust &amp;amp; Safety ML organization at Discord is responsible for helping reduce harm on the platform using machine learning, from proactive detection of harmful content to building scalable reactive systems for reported content. In this role, you&#39;ll lead a high-performing team of ML scientists and engineers while collaborating extensively with Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Legal, Policy, and Adaptive Data teams. At the same time, we’re looking to expand into using ML for fraud prevention and security detection and response in further efforts to keep Discord users safe. This role reports to our Senior Director of AI and Machine Learning and will be critical to this expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical vision and execution of Discord&#39;s Safety ML stack, emphasizing SOTA ML technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and organize teams across key functional areas including Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, and Content Moderation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional stakeholders to drive safety initiatives and demonstrate ML&#39;s impact on user safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead innovation in creative data sourcing and model development to move key safety metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide technical decision-making around ML architecture and infrastructure choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and grow technical leaders within the Safety ML organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in machine learning, data science, or related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading teams building ML products at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success driving Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Fraud Prevention, or Content Moderation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of applying ML techniques to consumer-facing problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Policy, Legal, and Trust &amp;amp; Safety teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance technical excellence with practical business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling and organizing technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $342,000 to $376,150 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;inclusion, diversity and purpose efforts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, company &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/the-seven-principles-of-working-at-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;principles&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, or learn more about the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/careers#life-discord&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life @ Discord&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; experience!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a technical, hands-on, and mission-focused Engineering Manager to join our &lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-17bf46fd-48aa-80a5-b0d6-001cb69d95bf notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ads&lt;/span&gt; team. This org just started last year and is growing fast. You’ll be responsible for building and scaling our ads platform from its foundations. You will lead a full-stack team of engineers working across platforms to build revenue driving products and services at Discord.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product, Design, Business Development and Marketing to drive your team’s vision and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a team of engaged engineers by hiring, coaching, and instilling best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on designing scalable technical solutions, and help to set the technical strategy of our ads architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instill a culture that both drives both impactful results and delights the end user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your technical expertise and ensure your team delivers extraordinary results at the &lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/category/engineering&quot;&gt;high technical level we set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound first-principle decisions around resourcing, and making the rationale clear to partners and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with your senior manager on strategic planning and to improve the Engineering organization and uphold our workplace philosophy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience as a Software Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of experience as an Engineering Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate closely with product managers, designers, data scientists, and other engineers to define great solutions to business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take pride in delivering a delightful experience for end users, stakeholders and anyone you work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are motivated to help your team members succeed and have experience growing engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code doesn&#39;t scare you - you are still an engineer even if you don&#39;t do it all the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the gaming industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with ad tech (especially tooling, measurement and targeting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a Discord user, and understand the core features and flow of Discord communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $223,000 to $245,500 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity, or benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
