&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a technical, hands-on, and mission-focused Engineering Manager to lead the Financial Platform team. You’ll be responsible for business-critical revenue accounting, tax, and payout integrations, along with supporting new products such as a virtual currency. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You will lead a full-stack team of driven engineers to ensure Discord’s revenue operations are transparent, scalable, and accurate, and accelerate product development teams by abstracting hard financial engineering problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; To learn more about Discord Engineering, take a look at our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://blog.discord.com/tagged/engineering&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1648422877&quot;&gt;engineering blog!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead an exceptional team of engaged engineers by coaching, hiring, and fostering a culture of ownership and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical vision and roadmap for Financial Platform by collaborating with stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Accounting, Legal, and Tax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the team to design solutions that support existing revenue lines at scale and enable rapid growth of new products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your technical and domain expertise to ensure your team delivers extraordinary results at the high technical level we set.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound, first-principle decisions around resourcing with clear rationale to partners and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with other Engineering leaders to continuously improve the Engineering organization and uphold our&amp;nbsp;workplace philosophy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience as a Software Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have 2+ years of experience as an Engineering Manager and have successfully managed a team of 5+ Software Engineers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong communication skills and the ability to work well cross-functionally with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record leading platform teams and you understand the tradeoffs necessary to enable client teams while simultaneously improving your own domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a first principles thinker who can work with others to come up with pragmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are motivated to help your team members succeed and have experience growing engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about coaching and leading other engineers, but secretly love to roll up your sleeves and getting elbow deep in code when the opportunities arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
