&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Discord’s Executive Protection program, and oversee the operations of the contract Executive Protection team, maintain contractor relationships, coordinate logistics, develop policy, and manage relationships with executives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive risk assessments and develop security strategies and policies for the protection of Discord executives and high risk employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of the Executive Protection budget, tracking expenditures and ensuring that Discord resources are spent appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze EP expenditures and prepare presentations for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Marketing Team, develop and oversee event security plans tailored to the event being supported, allowing Discord employees, partners, and users to focus on conducting business in a safe and supportive environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, implement, and manage security preparedness and emergency protocols for Discord events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct QAQC and process improvement on EP operations and the program as a whole, ensuring consistent high levels of service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with an ESOC, track, evaluate and address threats to Discord executives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Administrative Business Partners, plan and coordinate logistics for executive business and personal travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other tasks and duties as assigned by the Corporate Security Senior Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree or equivalent education / experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience working in executive protection, law enforcement, military or other protection related fields. Bonus if you have experience working in Event Security as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working on Executive Protection teams, conducting threat assessments, risk mitigation, security planning, and residential security.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience tracking, managing, analyzing and auditing security budgets, expenditures and contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting spend analysis to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with senior executives and their families in both professional and personal settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating detailed security plans for domestic and international travel and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort and experience working in an environment with multiple reporting structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working collaboratively with stakeholders internal and external to Discord, such as Executive Business Partners, Events / Marketing Teams, law enforcement, and government agencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attitude of customer service, open-mindedness, collaboration, flexibility, and initiative.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Discord app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
