&lt;p&gt;The Discord Safety Team seeking a highly skilled and motivated Product Launch Program Manager. In this role, you will be responsible for establishing a readiness process for product launches from scratch, collaborating with various stakeholders, and preparing the groundwork for project managers to effectively lead product teams through the established process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Development and Execution:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and refine a launch process tailored to the organization&#39;s specific needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the initial Launch Project Manager for a subset of Product Pillars to effectively lead product teams through the established process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with internal and external stakeholders to understand their perspectives, needs, and expectations related to launch readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster relationships with project managers, product teams, and other relevant parties to ensure alignment with organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and Standards:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create comprehensive documentation outlining the launch process, including standards, guidelines, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the established process complies with industry standards and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and Awareness:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training materials and conduct sessions to educate project managers and product teams on the launch process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote awareness and understanding of the process across the organization through effective communication channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish mechanisms for feedback and continuous improvement of the launch process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and monitor key performance indicators and adjust the process as needed to enhance efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in program management or a related role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with product launches and process management in the fields of Trust &amp;amp; Safety, Content Policy, or similar operational fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with a track record of successfully implementing processes from inception&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills to effectively collaborate with and influence diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industry standards and best practices related to product launch processes and operational readiness for a Safety Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to an ambiguous, dynamic environment and drive change within the organizatios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
