&lt;p&gt;This role offers the unique opportunity to define your team’s vision, influence company strategies, and pioneer advancements in data-driven advertising. You’ll thrive in a dynamic, fast-growing environment where you’ll build and scale a high-performing team to drive transformative insights and measurable impact. Reporting to the Director of Data Science Analytics for Advertising, you will lead initiatives that combine cutting-edge analytics and research with a passion for delivering exceptional advertiser value in the mobile and gaming-centric industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If helping make Discord an even better place to hang out with your friends and communities sounds like an exciting challenge - we&#39;d love to chat with you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
