&lt;li&gt;Own the measurement strategy, operations, goals, and learning plans for large customer verticals, ensuring alignment with advertiser needs and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and evaluate experimental and causal analytics frameworks to improve ad performance and advertiser ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data, Sales, Product, and Product Marketing leadership to refine and enhance Discord’s ad product GTM through data-driven insights with a high bar of scientific rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and oversee measurement operations across first- and third-party solutions, ensuring we deploy robust methodologies and create actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Data Science to conduct meta-analyses at the vertical, market, and country levels, developing ad efficacy research and playbooks rooted in sound data science principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable tools and dashboards to deliver actionable insights for sales and advertisers, empowering confident decision-making to improve ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance data fluency and measurement competency across your team, Sales, and other cross-functional partners through training and collaborative people development projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and partner to key advertisers to deepen the relationship between Discord, Advertiser, and Agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in applied data science, advanced analytics, and measurement within the mobile apps, gaming, and related DR verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of leadership experience managing and developing teams of 5+ Data Scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in designing and analyzing experiments (e.g., A/B testing) and applying causal inference methods to real-world problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and at least one data programming language (Python, R, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep mobile ad tech and measurement experience, including working on mobile attribution logic, mobile identity graphs, mobile ad delivery optimization, and mobile measurement partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of statistical concepts, including causal modeling, time series analysis, sampling approaches, and data mining techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with the ability to translate complex technical concepts into actionable insights for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern BI tools (e.g., Hex, Mode, Looker, Tableau) to create clear, insightful visualizations and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage competing priorities and deliver high-impact results in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the digital advertising ecosystem, including campaign measurement and performance optimization for Brand and Direct Response campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree (Master’s or Ph.D.) in a quantitative field such as statistics, economics, computer science, or engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with the largest global advertisers in mobile gaming, real money gaming, and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in machine learning models for forecasting, targeting, or personalization within advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-based data platforms and tools, such as BigQuery or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of data governance and compliance practices, including responsible use of PII for advertising measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing innovative data science solutions to solve complex business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Discord’s online communities and the products we build to bring joy to them every day.&lt;/li&gt;
