&lt;li&gt;You will craft the standard for visual caliber and quality on Platform Ecosystems (your team); owning the execution and production quality, and proactively identify opportunities to uplevel the quality of your work in production as you playtest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will Partner with the Platform Ecosystems Design Director to lead vision-setting initiatives on Platform Ecosystems, bringing diverse product ideas into one cohesive vision with tactical design deliverables, and regularly present and communicate your designs to peers and executives to gain alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will define and influence Platform Ecosystem’s roadmap with a deep understanding of the product space, acting as a thought leader with your XFN leads in defining the “how” of the product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
