&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an impact-focused Staff Engineer to join our world-class Revenue group as an E-commerce specialist as we accelerate Discord’s growth by enabling sophisticated e-commerce browsing and content promotion experiences. These product lines allow us to grow our business while keeping Discord’s core functionality free. To learn more about Discord Engineering, take a look at our &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.discord.com/tagged/engineering&quot;&gt;engineering blog!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
